#==============================================================================================
#
#   radio_button_paintable - Painting::RadioButtonPaintable: the paintable of
#                            <input type=radio>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/RadioButtonPaintable.cpp (lines 1-89) and
#       RadioButtonPaintable.h: creation, and painting the button's circles (a 1px outer and
#       2px inner border at 13x13) in the input colors of its color scheme and accent color.
